  "description": "Stunning Modern 2-Bed / 2-Bath Apartment Above Lighthouse Cinema with Rooftop Garden Access\nMonthly Rent: €3,100\nSecurity Deposit: €3,100 (One month's rent)\nAvailable From: 19 October 2026\nLease Term: 12 Months Minimum\nFurnishing: Fully Furnished\n\nProperty Description\nLive in the heart of Dublin 7. This exceptionally bright and spacious apartment offers contemporary urban living at its finest. The property boasts an unbeatable, ultra-convenient location beside the Luas Red Line, directly above One Escape Gym and the Lighthouse Cinema, and is surrounded by Smithfield's great restaurants and cafes.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a large open-plan living and dining area flooded with natural light, a private balcony overlooking the vibrant Smithfield Square, and a fully integrated modern kitchen. The property has two double bedrooms, including one very large master bedroom complete with a private en-suite bathroom. The second double bedroom features built-in wardrobes, and there is a stylish main bathroom off the hallway. Residents also enjoy exclusive access to a spectacular communal roof garden offering panoramic views across Dublin City.\n\nKey Features\n\n* Premier Location: Situated beside the Luas, directly above One Escape Gym and the Lighthouse Cinema\n* Two Double Bedrooms: Features one very large double bedroom with a private en-suite and a second double bedroom with built-in storage\n* Exclusive Roof Garden access with stunning panoramic city views\n* Parking can be arranged if needed €100 per month\n* Heating: Efficient electric heating system\n* Private Balcony overlooking Smithfield Square\n* Secure Building with fob entry, intercom, and lift access\n\n## Unbeatable Location & Transport\n\n* Transport: Located right beside the Smithfield LUAS Stop (Red Line), connecting you to the city centre, IFSC, and Heuston Station in minutes. Dublin Bikes stations are right outside.\n* Dining & Culture: Surrounded by great local restaurants, artisan coffee shops, and entertainment right on your doorstep.\n\nRequirements\n\n* References required upon application.\n\n\n",
